{"job_id":"F-53a96a96aa6ed10d7544","family_id":"F-53a96a96aa6ed10d7544","title":"국가유산보호기금법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":9,"target_id":"e38738c670b534a85e72e8ef9db2c327245b9969a741ef0cfd05bba812282837","source_hash":"b67dc6e4127e06bbb486cb14f1724a7efa06bbb9d9413e1451062a78c1904ac0","text":"国家遗产保护基金法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":120,"target_id":"b8a564fc25a2f3a7fc4cfe82a046bab0aceee98b0ab0b80d10dab922dc8f1790","source_hash":"99e5cfe72009dcc2fd227b630279b6a757ed0dd829ba59cbb2c2e2132331e0cc","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是设立国家遗产保护基金，以筹集有效保护和管理国家遗产所需的资金，并规定其管理和运作的必要事项。<2023年8月8日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":120,"end":318,"target_id":"d34b201e831892224248e9015e9c7c9e9d642723ee53f2404296884282d7e257","source_hash":"f4eb18db265b40bd8b8bf4c2d64b6f1ec66782363475cd0101d530d229797656","text":"第二条（定义）本法中使用的术语含义如下。\n1.“国家遗产”是指根据《国家遗产框架法》第3条所认定的国家遗产。\n2.“指定文化遗产”是指根据《文化遗产保存和利用法》第二条第三款指定的文化遗产。\n3.“天然纪念物等”是指根据《自然遗产保护和利用法》第二条第五款规定的天然纪念物等。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":318,"end":411,"target_id":"a7105d7bea0a5c7c9ef4414177862f14380e8a8e8ef427db6bdfbe192d0ed324","source_hash":"0b491514c32cb73c3bf58e4438380914a15f121b71d87450f18757f0452629fb","text":"第三条（基金的设立）政府设立国家遗产保护基金（以下简称“基金”），以保障国家遗产的保护和管理所需的财政资源。<2023年8月8日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":411,"end":911,"target_id":"c9f27909ae87bde4c5769ee66b1227c6123f3052393155a71259c505e3f3a460","source_hash":"f92a81d4ff5e9aa568689356fdab11de9238b36ab21def39ed046a6dc007da9c","text":"第四条（基金的设立）\n① 该基金应由下列各项的资源设立。\n1. 政府拨款\n2. 除政府以外的个人捐赠或提供的现金、货物或其他财产\n3. 根据《彩票和彩票基金法》从彩票基金进行的转移\n4. 根据第 2 段付款\n5. 基金的投资回报\n6. 总统令规定的其他收入\n② 依据《文化遗产保护与利用法》第49条和第74条规定收取指定文化遗产门票费的国家和地方政府，或依据《自然遗产保护与利用法》第63条规定收取自然纪念物等门票费的国家和地方政府，应当将所收取金额的10%上缴基金。<2016年2月3日修订，2023年8月8日再次修订>\n③ 依第1款第2项规定作出捐赠或捐献的人，可以指定捐赠或捐献的用途，用于支持特定的国家遗产。<2023年8月8日修订>\n4. 根据第 2 款规定，收款程序、收款方式、付款时间以及收款相关材料的提交等事项，由总统令规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":911,"end":1317,"target_id":"c71171046d2176425c2d6b446134ccd8e9ef76e59edc91273066c95ec21e1186","source_hash":"636fc2cae700635b823f5e950c2b0d63cd24a8662682b4eddcc1a7ec7ebb6532","text":"第五条（资金用途） 基金可用于下列任何用途：<2016年2月3日、2016年12月20日、2021年5月18日、2023年8月8日修订>\n1. 国家遗产保护的预防性管理\n2. 因损坏、遗失等原因对国家遗产进行紧急修复或重建。\n3. 小规模或紧急挖掘埋藏文物\n4. 根据第1条和第3条对损失进行赔偿\n5. 促进和支持私营部门参与国家遗产保护活动\n6. 为研究国家遗产保护、管理和安全政策的组织提供运营费用支持\n7. 根据《埋藏文物保护与调查法》第十三条第一款第三项，对废弃寺庙遗址等非指定国家级文物进行调查研究\n8. 紧急征用境内外重要国家遗产\n9. 根据总统令\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1317,"end":1566,"target_id":"a7115964bf9c7b03a26a92f66f0d483b4762907b31bbee9180fb8f4f9af5cd65","source_hash":"78076fc576e3bb68456f55c26c22fa49d3e281ee48984bdefc4bd9f2d4939f7c","text":"第六条（基金的管理和运作）\n① 本基金由国家文物局局长管理和运作。<2024年2月13日修订>\n② 国家遗产管理局局长可将基金的管理和运作事务全部或部分委托给依据《国家遗产基本法》第三十二条设立的国家遗产振兴院，或委托给国家遗产管理局局长以总统令指定的法人。<2014年5月28日、2023年8月8日、2024年2月13日修订>\n③ 基金管理和运作所需的其他事项，由总统令规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1566,"end":2059,"target_id":"66071196b36cd9c37eaf61a606ff32c5a86d41b15d007f2edaaf92370477e036","source_hash":"f238790f2ec321a019116b0e3ff23363a0d77a5e92fc3cd1d2f763b1cde9cc0d","text":"第七条（国家文物保护基金委员会）\n① 为审议有关国家文物保护基金管理和运作的下列事项，将在国家文物管理局局长领导下设立国家文物保护基金审议委员会（以下简称“委员会”）。<2021年12月21日、2023年8月8日、2024年2月13日修订>\n1. 基金管理和运作的关键政策\n2. 根据《国家财政法》第66条制定拟议的基金管理计划\n3. 根据《国家财政法》第70条第2款，主要项目支出金额的变更\n4. 根据《国家财政法》第85-6条第1款编制基金绩效报告，并根据该法第73条编制基金结算报告\n5. 总统令规定的有关基金管理和运作的重要事项，以及审议委员会主席认为有必要提交会议讨论的其他事项。\n② 理事会成员（包括主席）中至少半数应由非公职人员或非国家文物保护组织成员担任。<2023年8月8日修订>\n③ 审议委员会的组成和运作以及其他必要事项，由总统令规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2059,"end":2099,"target_id":"f5ea30a9a228aaf224602e6886ecf12bb2b40738be0c82ed9a4d732092c3f02c","source_hash":"e861df19ebe3b78de10cb3e65fc56988f380a1912dd0b9d2ff6bce4720605906","text":"第八条（基金财政年度）基金的财政年度与政府的财政年度一致。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2099,"end":2139,"target_id":"b1e9d3f1d3f901cec27c2b3d9943d8bf25c4397e217a1d683d3c42169d0b584c","source_hash":"4449d6a937624c24eca46cab4415e79c46362279853afbe81636f88a4f7739bc","text":"第九条（基金的会计处理）基金应当按照公司会计原则进行会计处理。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2139,"end":2258,"target_id":"64db28f36f4379401544c9b0ceaeb9ae1a72478768affa30f826a227255407d2","source_hash":"ebcf1d344c77d25d82c9d9cd6d903a2548944109684740e4cfa371ce0d3c68f1","text":"第十条（基金的会计机构）国家文物管理局局长应当从其下属官员中任命基金收入征收员、基金财务员、基金支出员和基金出纳员，负责基金的收入和支出事宜。<2024年2月13日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2258,"end":2334,"target_id":"c4497bf27b82d94edfdeaf1575d23d5f299a4d073754bea47a0521372d749347","source_hash":"015acd31190b6cab4b03a85ee8a3626c62d41fee09dbbe70833fc7fa7f0b006e","text":"第11条（设立基金账户）国家遗产厅厅长应当指示基金拨付员在韩国银行设立基金账户。<2024年2月13日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2334,"end":2467,"target_id":"3e02e3cc1df8f6a09d1a93745c2a225083329422e56bffe6069b62a792df8c52","source_hash":"8e750e9fbd7023a1d9153ffde392f4c129a217a7b2497e96b181e8b2dafc7f9c","text":"第十二条（禁止用于非预期用途）\n① 接受资助的人不得将资助用于接受资助时指定的用途以外的任何用途。\n② 如获资助的资金被用于非指定用途，国家文物管理局局长应取消资助并追回资金。<2024年2月13日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2467,"end":2602,"target_id":"8fb13192cf53197d56335e6b1d6647f17a38210929f78b0ff33d30d889b08fef","source_hash":"0af302367d375d44179380c5fb15821d0abbca786aadeb46ba7fc9af9d203953","text":"第十三条（适用处罚的公职人员） 凡根据第六条第二款受托管理、经营基金的法人机构的负责人和雇员，在适用《刑法》第一百二十九条至第一百三十二条的处罚时，均视为公职人员。<2023年8月8日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2602,"end":2654,"target_id":"bc6404020956268f041460947a120e94ed94f38d22f9bed25e48b0f39ac119f7","source_hash":"d8824a3fca6511c520bc11944bd0b92d7c599950934558d89aa2eebb61b6b38e","text":"补充规定 <第9756号，2009年6月9日>\n\n本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2654,"end":2686,"target_id":"2e66ba133f535101f596f09fac65810ebafa961bf9580e95e6cc232923583e74","source_hash":"399ca4a45c326df8882df1fd0278d073291505692fc440ff67a06fb66571a061","text":"增补（文化遗产保护法）<第12692号法令，2014年5月28日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2686,"end":2725,"target_id":"5e1a69321332e4e1ef06a7239b056e7b58af3cdacb1d2eb782d6b6d174d2ac0a","source_hash":"635e9a308f0ee078eeb1cb21d356a7e8b507048f288b15fe119855b417884f6f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起三个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2725,"end":2733,"target_id":"54f99c464de843a5eae647504a68ef90d3db3e1fd96d40221260c8b16241cd9f","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2733,"end":2869,"target_id":"0d4833c3ac46664c7f6d788416cc0b5031eb270384015458b9d79b6b25c3489b","source_hash":"fae39b5759d6cb4db91cfd407992741d5af89d1e4bf88f97048654ffbb72a727","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ②《文化遗产保护基金法》部分修改如下。\n\n  第六条第二款中，“根据《文化遗产保护法》第九十六条设立的韩国文化遗产保护基金会”应改为“根据《文化遗产保护法》第九条设立的韩国文化遗产保护基金会”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2869,"end":2912,"target_id":"86785c4a2e36a09b37f7d3f24c97c585fe7296a2de2c8cf219644a0a1b447c68","source_hash":"57b0a42155efbae54cd4645cfa56c9d0baf396dd50840e21258701d20eb8fe85","text":"补充规定 <第13963号，2016年2月3日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2912,"end":2957,"target_id":"9dfd0b615e0125712b375f7996c47d528ecb2f5d64c57951dfc89e244ca3e19b","source_hash":"d77fe3477990eab089ce5116ad0e36e352dbcbff13220860c6f824403620dca4","text":"补充规定 <第14435号，2016年12月20日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2957,"end":2990,"target_id":"b4150abe11816b4d990ed00ec5ac14f52b0c0d6af232731272f6ea197220f045","source_hash":"6e44b9e7027e4cc30510a8f3a5b33f77968f0ee6faa413f3cdf8852bd390631e","text":"增补（文化遗产保护法）<第16596号，2019年11月26日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2990,"end":3037,"target_id":"e9fe1a0b6093136e91b832882c3ab6f8caa42cdc971263e4ae0383a717e154bb","source_hash":"7172cc4526b19c95db24e19764f4986d5189e2c90036101ff4ce5f11bcad947d","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3037,"end":3054,"target_id":"73ce2092d4d32c90aafe8c93b0346da3751319f9e1c343ec9857134ea2a27cc9","source_hash":"9c668f5a2d31a12403cc16a9e4f5410caea7fad78df52e49a6877577af85a298","text":"省略第 2 至 8 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3054,"end":3112,"target_id":"27299920f943dda8b3ede61d4d33756838a0fa1e92fae45413aece944e7ff34e","source_hash":"b9f393e71abc2264ad26375598cb52c07c8f73fe298783d07c2885192814534c","text":"第九条（修改其他法律）①至③ 已省略\n\n  ④ 《文化遗产保护基金法》部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3112,"end":3154,"target_id":"4cce9f1509acddd89673e552f464fdfdd1f05915140b50bf2bdaf321ab29f3e3","source_hash":"8cc0b4f8aa4b5b75a1cab872a2f66ebda8010d1cf52a2fb5f79ef23501bb6b4d","text":"  第 2 条中的“第 2 款”应改为“第 3 款”。\n\n  省略⑤至⑭\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3154,"end":3163,"target_id":"fb1e325dda624dd57cd2aa77b4dce8b16365bfa6cfd6eb5cc49bfa77e322e638","source_hash":"096ca2f054778653faea54e5b71972bca5c5566689631bffec48a45317d41776","text":"第 10 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3163,"end":3217,"target_id":"12accbc9177d0f914919d4b4992a79dc6c6a2d58e8bce30a268405fd0b2056d6","source_hash":"962c8ce7974fa22b645f357391011391f1b269880e3540e2d696e11f7b16624a","text":"补充规定 <第18156号，2021年5月18日>\n\n本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3217,"end":3249,"target_id":"ff19f8cbdbb16716ff51c89f8b2f1b6b285d80dc68577b11dfbd24d457d07257","source_hash":"59bba5bde3469db82f9e5fe8c2918068b44c9a66bc4bddd461962c4432316a9b","text":"补充条款（国家财政法）<第18585号法案，2021年12月21日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3249,"end":3286,"target_id":"e3c35a1efeffb3bc8c0ef061cfcf1046184780561e42b262b131cd3c79648913","source_hash":"77e4eac38cf5346e4d3701817301fd26d851b6877590858f210e37892c19254d","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3286,"end":3294,"target_id":"75690e16c978032134c8a8aa5c1ec053d371629fb247d5220664a2c243e9a40c","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3294,"end":3407,"target_id":"ee51e0ea7f9c16aa7318cbc5c6c497d4ed8886950f36be349b3232e8322e679b","source_hash":"f036da9a4f314fce71d9473b416368d352313143e15666ae87f5cb595f641117","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①和②已省略\n\n  ③ 《文化遗产保护基金法》部分修改如下。\n\n  第七条第一款第四项中的“第八条第三款”应改为“第八十五条第六款第一项”。\n\n  跳过④到⑦\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3407,"end":3430,"target_id":"195eed0754b192b79b7751f3e8b6dceac00d39b196689eff1a2367b287af0bab","source_hash":"7c5d70740b5575c6726d94dadfddf001a429d2ee4066779fb9dadf13b49824e3","text":"补充条款 <第19589号，2023年8月8日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3430,"end":3466,"target_id":"ba99cff81ed51157c2c9218b0d73b36cf0ebf43bba639c409d9f9848a3985a1f","source_hash":"7350e3f548b874a9832ac9215cecfa05d6eabf1786692f383b38eef25c138d19","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自2024年5月17日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3466,"end":3551,"target_id":"6275d318f04126499b11bf9353ec8e63f82c574cdb592eb74af04380da827c3f","source_hash":"80b953499975e2495b723d7aa5ab3a2d4f5fe4b3f136ba93322eed44c86a04b7","text":"第二条（关于设立审议委员会的过渡措施）根据先前规定设立的文化遗产保护基金审议委员会在本法实施时，应视为根据本法设立的国家遗产保护基金审议委员会。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3551,"end":3592,"target_id":"46d329274c8562b29056c0991767664c86eb90d4cd9c8fd9b8a1daadb3d5fc28","source_hash":"bf7ac168a365aa6470a74e76062cc63b7da7511dcbb06a5b8b2d1e257d94cef2","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①《国家财政法》部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00037","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3592,"end":3756,"target_id":"b80c55fd7c685b19bf5b2592117f43f165fb79194e2901ef51df149a672f7485","source_hash":"214977a1330800e2fbc620d2b4414d3826703fce027c7fcabe8af56d8f5cc7ec","text":"  附件表 2，第 63 项修改如下。\n\n    63.《国家遗产保护基金法》\n\n  ② 《彩票及彩票基金法》部分修改如下。\n\n  第二十三条第一款第六项规定如下。\n\n    6. 根据《国家文物保护基金法》第3条设立的国家文物保护基金\n\n  附件表 6 如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00038","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3756,"end":3948,"target_id":"698c1a398f5365bed3bafefbcc8aff845a9f17e96672701ce0fa1d29296be7dd","source_hash":"e9efe665ad6c836023847d984367c454919fceb7bd9243841477bcb88bfae07f","text":"第四条（与其他法律的关系）在本法实施时，其他法律（包括在本法实施前颁布但尚未生效的法律）提及原《文化遗产保护基金法》或其条文，而本法有相应条文的，应视为已援引本法或本法的有关条文代替原《文化遗产保护基金法》或其条文。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00039","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3948,"end":4031,"target_id":"72accc6be2f3eac8a515410f7d340efbf0c619cabbadc2a738b23ab2ac024761","source_hash":"786e12627a812571c095bbbc1babe8dbf9dd287156a19c35e5cbfe809d40c24f","text":"补充规定（对文化、体育和旅游委员会管辖的43项法律进行部分修订，以修订法律术语）<第19592号法案，2023年8月8日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00040","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4031,"end":4062,"target_id":"41a324edc5d061348c5528827b0a777354ceb4bc9bfa3ca3d1ff56de13052895","source_hash":"c8fbb6554730caf2edf6459a82dadd8ed918525812708b04407ff67b65e18629","text":"补充条款（政府组织法）<第20309号法令，2024年2月13日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00041","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4062,"end":4188,"target_id":"adddafc5486adbaba0f632fd160d5b6ea371fac5a0b6e019fdc8b6405793258c","source_hash":"ce258539d0bcb55da39bd7dea27333f02133fa59a07e4a34150b84ad7eaee7c4","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自2024年5月17日起生效。但是，根据附录第四条修改的法律中，修改在本法生效前已颁布但生效日期尚未到来的法律的条款，应自该等法律各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00042","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4188,"end":4202,"target_id":"6ec1a2444e2868e9c8d28863e989b4c2efafa6682f12f5e1e78494259df825d7","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00043","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4202,"end":4360,"target_id":"6d0e504b7041126c13c7f908c27283b723b73cb449f6f0e498be4597166818f3","source_hash":"8e4d65d4234d836ca93472ffe0b4469424a0b00e5e13c01a752082c37c9df9e8","text":"第四条（其他法律的修正）①至⑬ 已省略\n\n  14. 《文化遗产保护基金法》部分修改如下。\n\n  第六条第一款和第二款，除第七条第一款、第十条、第十一条和第十二条第二款的子款外，“文化遗产管理局局长”应改为“国家遗产管理局局长”。\n\n  省略 ⑮ 到 <33>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00044","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011022-260477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4360,"end":4366,"target_id":"d06e565275c4e2857ff4a29203bb7c1c68692b882eee1e28cb568291a729e596","source_hash":"52aefd19ad92afb7e0440de9711a2a890e97fd145879356b7b04cc07d2ca9c9a","text":"第5条省略"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":13,"target_id":"86d1759a110fe2a7340c380001da41f7b52faaa7f4d445c567b9be1211acbb27","source_hash":"257d8b3b3f7b2cf9adcce0f2e093e0d679be41e4e1d7729a8ec81b94cbfb9ccb","text":"《国家遗产保护基金法》实施令"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":78,"target_id":"07a0f5ac2d1d8ae0da373db35c31c4a960729942f82908a2ca253b6403bdbc43","source_hash":"180a72963fbeec164ef3d8db243af211bd7fda8d4dff812b016ae7ab44468b9b","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定《国家遗产保护基金法》委托事项以及为执行该法所必需的事项。<2024年5月7日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":78,"end":228,"target_id":"dbf8763c7836d72f2a827c2e9fb0990e8776efd2509753c8deccd8fd20d489f5","source_hash":"6c26ade6abcae29848344c846d848073c2a79b1a4edb2156ecd181e72e1d95ea","text":"第二条（国家文物保护基金的设立）《国家文物保护基金法》（以下简称“本法”）第四条第一款第六项中，“总统令规定的收入”是指下列各款规定的收入。<2024年5月7日修订>\n1. 从其他资金转账\n2. 国家文物管理局局长确认的其他收入\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":228,"end":613,"target_id":"46c307e302104092f9c92f9fd62ea3503e42b7f28f890851122b826c8f25850c","source_hash":"fa6bc87378157f0f7fa6d518126f16dcd94ec437af31d511292636a4729d4c70","text":"第三条（收款程序等）\n① 依据本法第四条第二款规定收取指定文化遗产、自然纪念物等景点门票的国家和地方政府，应当根据每月最后一天收取的门票收入确定应缴金额，并依据本法第三条规定，于次月10日前缴入国家遗产保护基金（以下简称“基金”）。<2024年5月7日修订>\n② 国家文物管理局局长可向依第一款缴纳会费的州政府和地方政府补贴其运作所需的费用。<2024年5月7日修订>\n③ 依据本法第四条第二款规定收取指定文化遗产、自然纪念物等门票费用的国家和地方政府，应当保存并妥善保管用于计算应收金额的基本资料，例如门票收费收据、收费报表、收费存折等，保存期限为五年。<2024年5月7日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":613,"end":809,"target_id":"063614e039df43fc3b3ee22bc1881c384bec48029e08330d22f05794e67b7d8b","source_hash":"bb88c026c2f631455a3ad9ea49325beca1a2f8efc7c5f8bbffcefb91cd6daa4a","text":"第四条（基金用途）本法第五条第九款所称“总统令规定的业务或活动”是指下列各款所列的业务或活动。<2017年12月5日、2021年9月14日、2024年5月7日修订>\n1. 删除<2021.9.14>\n2. 删除<2017.12.5>\n3. 支持国家遗产的保护和教育\n4. 国家遗产的学术调查与研究\n5. 资金的筹集和管理/运作\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":809,"end":1366,"target_id":"d865fa19f78bd4614f38e68b192bc874372db96420be76fa063b7e6dc2176a76","source_hash":"0d41ced80b893314f20cead41246aa9ab2bfb040452b2ae7d8343d1878f19ef9","text":"第五条（基金的管理和运作）\n① 根据本法第六条第二款可委托管理的资金的管理和运作事宜，应按下列各款规定办理。<2024年5月7日修订>\n1. 资金管理和运作相关的会计事务\n2. 根据该法第4条第4款，有关收款和管理款项的事宜\n3. 基金盈余资金管理相关事宜\n4. 国家文物管理局局长确定的其他有关基金管理和运作的事项\n② 根据第一款受托管理基金运作事宜的人员，应当编制下一年度基金运作计划草案，并于每年5月31日前报送国家文物局局长。<2024年5月7日修订>\n③ 根据第一款受托管理基金运作事宜的人员，应于次年2月10日前向国家文物管理局局长提交基金结算报告。<2024年5月7日修订>\n④ 国家文物管理局局长可根据第1款规定，向受托管理基金运作事务的人员提供与上述事务相关的必要费用补贴。<2024年5月7日修订>\n⑤ 除本法令及《国家财政法》和相关法规规定外，基金管理和运作所需事项由国家遗产管理局局长决定。<2024年5月7日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1366,"end":1608,"target_id":"a96ab107eff0d7da8e862abc1a9b0cd811a0c6af8a561c29a16d1f46b80951b3","source_hash":"f2672e277625a6eb3128d3719e042290104d11e71853df06fe2e18fe8532bb2e","text":"第六条（基金盈余资金的运作）国家文物管理局局长可以按下列方式运作基金盈余资金：<2010年11月15日、2024年5月7日修订>\n1. 根据《银行法》在银行的存款、根据其他法律在金融公司进行的存款以及根据《邮政储蓄保险法》在邮政机构进行的存款\n2. 根据《资本市场和金融投资业务法》第4条购买证券\n3. 根据《公共资金管理基金法》存入公共资金管理基金\n4. 购买其他金融工具\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1608,"end":1968,"target_id":"235b5f9b06eec5156bfa701aae4e59e1e16fb0f0f26b88dcef5fb4b60018a74a","source_hash":"43f8cbaf27eaa4e4f6c9fd6bd744031a2eabdb4d5812d566f67781b1b18ca21b","text":"第七条（国家文物保护基金理事会的组成和运作）\n① 根据本法第七条设立的国家文物保护基金理事会（以下简称“理事会”）由不超过十名成员组成，其中包括一名主席。<2024年5月7日修订>\n② 审议委员会主席由国家文物管理局副局长担任，委员由国家文物管理局局长从下列各款所列人员中委任或任命。<2024年5月7日修订>\n1. 国家文物管理局高级公务员，负责基金事务\n2. 被公认为在基金管理和运作方面拥有广泛的专业知识和经验的人员\n3. 被公认为在国家遗产的保护、管理和利用方面拥有广泛的专业知识和经验的人员\n③ 根据第2款第2项和第3项规定，成员的任期为两年。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1968,"end":2227,"target_id":"b157564dc97d0e0810243b7fb359e33e7a53c0bc82fdf35b7b48d9c9cd8a3980","source_hash":"9e4099b08a08f64ffe2c96d3d767d47cb5b4256890bc9bd9caa9c2660606de24","text":"第七条之二（成员的解职和免职） 国家文物管理局局长可以解职或者免除依第七条第二款任命的成员的职务，但有下列情形之一的，则适用本条。<2024年5月7日修订>\n1. 如果因精神或身体残疾而无法履行职责\n2. 如发生与公务相关的渎职行为\n3. 若成员因玩忽职守、名誉受损或其他原因被认为不合适，\n4. 当成员表示难以履行其职责时\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2227,"end":2332,"target_id":"6204bcfdfcc8b1e6f031eebb13e215a4c2ce75ba97537417c68caa4c93d82b59","source_hash":"2f092941c7d9a7c3516cdd89df5c986704af16f55b4bfd9d5be1e273e1931b40","text":"第八条（主席的职责）\n主席代表理事会，并监督理事会的事务。\n② 如果主席因不可抗力因素无法履行职责，则由主席指定的成员代表主席行事。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00011","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2332,"end":2425,"target_id":"96e5a5a3ae8663ce9d6f831639df7f367d2944384200c00b6d02ec0ff46c1fc8","source_hash":"0890b5df0ab6f515e5d4793b26a32de98bab7533c17490a8fcb894c3ebcc20fd","text":"제9조(회의)\n主席召集审议委员会会议并主持会议。\n② 会议须由过半数注册会员出席方可召开，决议须由出席会议的过半数会员批准方可作出。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00012","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2425,"end":2530,"target_id":"278b105e0647cf9c5e5f5955f590367506a2dee4561c524e887c38768f6ea832","source_hash":"522f1bd85143f24d22cbd43b3febc4df56394a01d6e5b049ca866a60cb22b055","text":"第十条（秘书）\n① 理事会设一名秘书，由国家文物局局长从国家文物局的公职人员中指定。<2024年5月7日修订>\n② 秘书在主席的指导下处理审议委员会的行政事务。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00013","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2530,"end":2632,"target_id":"9228f2b7804b40af9dbc9c0fe0991dc0d78bb7159eacef7713005716b6d7c70a","source_hash":"60c31ddc819cc3f31def65a626cbe76a955bdd8c7d078d05583e0161025e412f","text":"第11条（津贴）出席审议委员会会议的成员可在预算范围内领取津贴。但因公职直接出席会议的成员不在此限。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00014","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2632,"end":2769,"target_id":"49480f412f937e6a6d50319e9ccfceda06c26be296379245747fe2db8372db07","source_hash":"0415e9285f88a9813309223c266592534ca3ead3b2f53e947cd9fa2f8a605bbb","text":"第十二条（基金的会计权限）国家遗产厅厅长依据本法第十条委任基金收入征收员、基金财务主管、基金支出主管和基金出纳员时，应当通知监察委员会会长、企划预算部长官和韩国银行行长。<2024年5月7日修订；2025年12月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00015","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2769,"end":2861,"target_id":"bce2cc377020e3df637951cc390762e7dea857686fe79292a7e240100f2d2758","source_hash":"58b46b787966d0d9423fcadb6f19472be4f2b9c53e48cfbce637555a6eb92b05","text":"第十三条（基金账户） 国立文物厅厅长依据本法第十一条在韩国银行设立基金账户时，应当将其分为收入账户和支出账户。<2024年5月7日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00016","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2861,"end":2948,"target_id":"a8575db56b10eeab6227db170f3b4d131f674738ac65a10711b1e57ac339276d","source_hash":"5ed3f76755c063980bef5edd15d3f5a292a266579d2d148649f29260f1c9f0e6","text":"第十四条（资金的接收）凡根据本法第四条第一款规定存入基金账户的资金，收款人应当立即将付款收据送交基金收入征收员。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00017","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2948,"end":3200,"target_id":"8d9c74039f29ff6bafd90e94c74f8c2b0ce8b1ac1cdeaa64cb5d3ae2eaa8d0da","source_hash":"0e6b05090dfc1fd58c1966f24ab7e7d5f926aac0e6481dd6b9d74fe5f02fa9e2","text":"第十五条（资金支出限额的分配）\n① 国家文物管理局局长应当按照《国家财政法》第六十八条第二款的规定，根据月度收支计划，向基金财务主管分配支出限额。<2024年5月7日修订>\n② 国立文物厅厅长根据第1款规定分配支出限额后，应当通知企划预算部长官和韩国银行。<2024年5月7日、2025年12月30日修订>\n③ 基金财务主管实施导致支出的行为时，支出不得超过根据第1款分配的支出限额。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00018","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3200,"end":3371,"target_id":"e702d475806b1b88fb16cd9375da2c85b41bba70ad7e6cecc14f4ec3bf9d648d","source_hash":"dc68d92848e64bb910e5cd737a7c09642d0000f9108a81f89bf9614c6f1e3c12","text":"第十六条（账簿保存）\n① 基金收入征收员和基金财务员应当编制并维护基金一般管理登记册、基金支出事由登记册和基金收款登记册，并记录基金收入和支出的总体情况以及基金支出事由登记册的情况。\n② 基金出纳员应当编制和维护基金账簿，并记录基金支出情况。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00019","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3371,"end":3423,"target_id":"737650cb83b2b2e644bc6969ca91644fc5e97c20921313a0d4caad5d71bba673","source_hash":"888385cd5d0f639ee89697ddc64c81ae76f6c26190698a993a2ec718e25688d7","text":"补充规定 <第21872号，2009年12月7日>\n\n本法令自2009年12月10日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00020","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3423,"end":3457,"target_id":"662edc3a18538aab263a3253298df90003615a7b2b0cef4c0691f3668c1ea43f","source_hash":"966f2233f7eb70873334861c60352a71614f47b3e5533a4089acb496e16da256","text":"补充条款（《银行法》实施令）<第22493号，2010年11月15日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00021","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3457,"end":3494,"target_id":"94727c0134ae3d10e11f955b23f47c3069655322d33e5229fece5939b0473147","source_hash":"1a2511134631edb1e784c0bf267523cdf8173659608031ae0749d23299195e6d","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2010年11月18日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00022","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3494,"end":3508,"target_id":"6df4d2c52c5cad7fcd4be20354f2df3fd7da25dee55a5f3d6acb5db6dce5f035","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00023","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3508,"end":3628,"target_id":"abcfbaa00a674db4bda7a4843c8ec4ba2558b97a4e65fce98fc9894a4430d9f2","source_hash":"f30010540446c62afc9da6ae7c17ee0bea1ab644d50de9faed1119fe4b40d696","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<45>款已省略\n\n  <46> 《文化遗产保护基金法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第六条第一款中的“金融机构”应改为“银行”。\n\n  <47> 至 <115> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00024","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3628,"end":3636,"target_id":"70ae40a726c86ed1799acea99583a5fa14ef1788163d640ba747309313009695","source_hash":"ef55f3731ca58fff2f2d0bd5b5c9566497eb6d021fc855ca0f395bb8ee15228d","text":"第5条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00025","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3636,"end":3735,"target_id":"056fb8a7b0cdaed82bebde28bf683416791f23d02efadfb634bcd71ae92d7329","source_hash":"e0b6febf5446679407c1fc9ef32b2e9f025574ca8db443d657881baa13b9142e","text":"增补（关于加强行政机关下属委员会运作公平性和问责制的《国民健康保险法实施细则》等的局部修订）<2015年12月31日第26844号>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00026","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3735,"end":3779,"target_id":"c11f0f75d551257f905196ff5a6a2658057336945c346f96472a4c2855b17e5d","source_hash":"436f9d923d9d44c0526fb8da1bd5204746240631ead5a1d103f6434786d66ffc","text":"补充规定 <第28458号，2017年12月5日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00027","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3779,"end":3831,"target_id":"5e9b76d7947246d536918c30e6f281427057aa6997e62af7a3364552a9ec24b7","source_hash":"b513bdd39100cfcfcf24bb64db150af93fd80204ba79db6ec4b064f2105c2cc2","text":"补充规定 <第31980号，2021年9月14日>\n\n本法令自2021年11月19日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00028","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3831,"end":3854,"target_id":"698828ee6ee03fcacd653f505cc0457042e91acc0dc9784e5f023264b5c5bcdc","source_hash":"1c793896aaeee0cbf7dfd8964c307368298048544042b8b51094434484e982b7","text":"补充规定 <第34493号，2024年5月7日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00029","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3854,"end":3890,"target_id":"10d05187e16ab299c943c5b5cd6c772ba3413758942374c37d0f6b5175ee900b","source_hash":"be3fde89724959cf9058dd863ce36ffb796e7e2904ea8e819443b99fa33418cb","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2024年5月17日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00030","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3890,"end":3955,"target_id":"3c44d1dc836a4ae4651a8bb0d1599b164250bc6a109e1fd402bed3b7a5487bee","source_hash":"10a763becffa1033eefda0d1a02652fe52cbb1544c279692b6945d988ac8ae1d","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①对《农业、林业、渔业和食品投资合伙企业成立和经营法》实施细则的部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00031","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3955,"end":4138,"target_id":"19671525e47cd2ad6ec332120fd4fee939f4d7caf7ffb3b0c9c20a39de468060","source_hash":"d965ac50594f45702514181eeb08356fb3f7997ecd33cd18690bd1d45545d4c8","text":"  附件表 1，第 63 项修改如下。\n\n    63. 根据《国家文物保护基金法》第3条设立的国家文物保护基金\n\n  ② 对《彩票及彩票基金法》实施细则的部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第十七条第一款第五项中的“根据《文化遗产保护基金法》第三条设立的文化遗产保护基金”应改为“根据《国家遗产保护基金法》第三条设立的国家遗产保护基金”。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00032","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4138,"end":4297,"target_id":"2e83cc5966f522a219e6cd04dd5e7bf4d543e08fd2411635ae31809d998e5f12","source_hash":"f939c19f55d2a9214754537dd1273d37395fcee89a9aae3eedfbde855b21f407","text":"第三条（与其他法律法规的关系）在本法令实施时，其他法律法规提及《文化遗产保护基金法》先前实施法令或其规定，而本法令中也有相应规定的，应当视为以本法令或本法令的有关规定代替《文化遗产保护基金法》先前实施法令或其规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00033","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4297,"end":4340,"target_id":"6657f909a828e085b97c898d45e218701c2ca22dfe89da1a17d5bbafbbb08dc1","source_hash":"e94cb060215343794849c45723917db1ef36905da0729360d1209f1fd79739ab","text":"增编（计划和预算部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第35948号，2025年12月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00034","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4340,"end":4470,"target_id":"f8f5f08a2268b02ef2727c4d392891820548030d8b4c88274c3d618f931ee80e","source_hash":"d91ca08ab13d680b646c74aa4763cd8612c6e937853e3db26fe10f30e26d8871","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2026年1月2日起生效。但是，根据本补充法令第四条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前颁布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00035","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4470,"end":4484,"target_id":"b5e34403a73c692276f3fad2d9d54a94608337e060365ede9dcdc0763bafc9e7","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00036","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4484,"end":4555,"target_id":"8a139dc00d7c964db0a995304a9e85c2326ba384858c96a49d88b29a42a7d5aa","source_hash":"cb1d938b96b56b985c2e9d72d8c69d9c206ac2d79074f4be8c4deb559a3e5426","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<164>款已省略\n\n  《国家遗产保护基金法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00037","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-011108-281735-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4555,"end":4625,"target_id":"aceb914667a05587c1a9cdafa77c1cf5f9a05f518ba41e4f42450d52facf9aab","source_hash":"81b54cfb8970af0bbd15de7e2615d1372e80b75fd4813ac169519ea12bd56c76","text":"  第 12 条和第 15 条第 2 款中的“战略和财政大臣”应改为“计划和预算大臣”。\n\n  <166> 至 <176> 已省略"}]}